Description: Sharp RGB->YUV conversion library (from libwebp)
 libsharpyuv is the shared sharp RGB-to-YUV conversion helper split out of
 libwebp in the 1.x series. Built for the Ladybird leaf closure; libwebp links
 it at runtime.
